      "text": "Zini makes fun of either Aezar or Grizzle while she can observe them within 30 feet of her. She attempts a Deception check check with a +2 circumstance bonus against the creature's Will DC. Zini cannot use this ability again against that creature until she spends at least 10 minutes thinking about a worthy second insult.\n\n---\nCritical Success As success, but the target also takes 1d4+2 mental damage.\n\nSuccess The target is Off-Guard against the next attack an ally attempts against the target before the beginning of Zini's next turn.\n\nFailure The target is unaffected.",
